{"sha": "2c14b3eafb87df2fe7dc2bfa1a2a56d7f30e623397e2f4c7e17b18f9eab8344f", "body": ["\\begin{theorem}\\label{thm:b3:forms:pullback}", "(a) $\\varphi^*(\\omega \\wedge \\eta) = \\varphi^*\\omega \\wedge", "\\varphi^*\\eta$ 和 $(\\psi \\circ \\varphi)^* = \\varphi^* \\circ", "\\psi^*$。", "(b) $\\varphi^*(\\dd\\omega) = \\dd(\\varphi^*\\omega)$：外微分", "与每一个光滑替换可交换，", "--- 正是这一恒等式使它成为本理论中\\emph{真正的}", "导数。", "(c) 若 $\\varphi\\colon U \\to V$ 是", "$\\R^n$ 中开集之间的光滑映射，且 $\\omega = a\\,\\dd y_1 \\wedge \\dots \\wedge \\dd", "y_n$，则 $\\varphi^*\\omega = (a \\circ", "\\varphi)\\,\\det\\bigl(D\\varphi\\bigr)\\,\\dd x_1 \\wedge \\dots", "\\wedge \\dd x_n$。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "(a) 关于线性拉回的逐点陈述", "（见\\cref{prop:b3:forms:linearpullback}），再加上链式法则", "$D(\\psi\\circ\\varphi)(x) = D\\psi(\\varphi(x))\\,D\\varphi(x)$。", "(b) 对 $0$-形式 $f$：$\\varphi^*(\\dd f) = \\dd f \\circ", "D\\varphi = \\dd(f \\circ \\varphi)$ 即链式法则。对", "$\\omega = a\\,\\dd y_I$，利用 (a)，$\\varphi^*\\omega =", "(a\\circ\\varphi)\\,\\dd\\varphi_{i_1}\\wedge\\dots\\wedge", "\\dd\\varphi_{i_k}$，于是由莱布尼茨法则", "（见\\cref{thm:b3:forms:dsquare}(a)）和 $\\dd\\dd\\varphi_{i_r} =", "0$：", "\\[", "\\dd(\\varphi^*\\omega) = \\dd(a\\circ\\varphi) \\wedge", "\\dd\\varphi_{i_1}\\wedge\\dots\\wedge\\dd\\varphi_{i_k}", "= \\varphi^*(\\dd a) \\wedge \\varphi^*(\\dd y_I)", "= \\varphi^*(\\dd a \\wedge \\dd y_I) =", "\\varphi^*(\\dd\\omega).", "\\]", "(c) 逐点地，这恰好就是最高次形式上的 $u^*\\alpha = (\\det u)\\alpha$", "（见\\cref{prop:b3:forms:linearpullback}(1)", "，取 $u = D\\varphi(x)$）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[极坐标]\\label{ex:b3:forms:polar}", "设 $\\varphi(r, \\theta) = (r\\cos\\theta, r\\sin\\theta)$：", "$\\varphi^*\\dd x = \\cos\\theta\\,\\dd r -", "r\\sin\\theta\\,\\dd\\theta$，$\\varphi^*\\dd y = \\sin\\theta\\,\\dd r", "+ r\\cos\\theta\\,\\dd\\theta$，于是", "\\[", "\\varphi^*(\\dd x \\wedge \\dd y) =", "(\\cos\\theta\\,\\dd r - r\\sin\\theta\\,\\dd\\theta) \\wedge", "(\\sin\\theta\\,\\dd r + r\\cos\\theta\\,\\dd\\theta)", "= r\\,\\dd r \\wedge \\dd\\theta,", "\\]", "\\cref{ex:b3:product:polar}中的雅可比行列式借纯代数", "自然出现 --- 无需任何测度论。\\cref{exo:b3:forms:9}把这一注记化为", "一个命题：对于定向积分，换元公式", "\\emph{正是}拉回公式。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{闭形式与恰当形式；庞加莱引理}", "", "\\begin{definition}\\label{def:b3:forms:closedexact}", "$\\omega \\in \\Omega^k(U)$ 称为\\emph{闭形式}\\index{闭形式}，若", "$\\dd\\omega = 0$；称为\\emph{恰当形式}\\index{恰当形式}，若", "$\\omega = \\dd\\eta$ 对某个 $\\eta \\in \\Omega^{k-1}(U)$ 成立（称为", "\\emph{原形式}，其外微分即为 $\\omega$）。恰当形式 $\\Rightarrow$ 闭形式，由", "$\\dd^2 = 0$；其逆命题是关于", "\\emph{形状}的问题，即 $U$ 具有怎样的形状。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}[角形式]\\label{ex:b3:forms:angular}", "在 $U = \\R^2 \\setminus \\{0\\}$ 上，", "\\[", "\\omega_\\theta = \\frac{x\\,\\dd y - y\\,\\dd x}{x^2 + y^2}", "\\]", "是闭形式（直接计算，见", "\\cref{exo:b3:forms:4}），但不是恰当形式：它沿单位圆的", "积分为 $2\\pi \\neq 0$，而恰当形式沿闭曲线的", "积分恒为零（见\\cref{prop:b3:forms:exactloop}）。", "局部地，$\\omega_\\theta = \\dd\\theta$ 对极角的任一光滑选取", "$\\theta$ 成立 --- 由此得名，", "并揭示障碍：在整个", "$U$ 上不存在这样的选取。这一形式串起环绕数", "（见\\cref{sec:b3:forms:winding}），并借此通向", "\\cref{ch:b3:residues}中的留数定理。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[庞加莱引理]\\label{thm:b3:forms:poincare}", "设 $U \\subseteq \\R^n$ 为开集，且为\\emph{星形}的（关于", "$0$）。每个闭 $k$-形式（定义在 $U$ 上，$k \\geq 1$）皆", "为恰当形式。\\index{庞加莱引理}", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "构造一个线性\\emph{同伦算子} $h\\colon", "\\Omega^k(U) \\to \\Omega^{k-1}(U)$，使得", "\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:b3:forms:homotopy}", "\\dd(h\\omega) + h(\\dd\\omega) = \\omega", "\\qquad (k \\geq 1);", "\\end{equation}", "若 $\\dd\\omega = 0$，则 $\\omega = \\dd(h\\omega)$，于是", "即得证。对 $\\omega = \\sum_I a_I\\,\\dd x_I$，令", "\\[", "h\\omega = \\sum_{\\abs I = k}\\ \\sum_{r=1}^{k}(-1)^{r-1}", "\\Bigl(\\int_0^1 t^{k-1}a_I(tx)\\,\\dd t\\Bigr)\\,", "x_{i_r}\\,\\dd x_{i_1}\\wedge\\dots\\wedge", "\\widehat{\\dd x_{i_r}}\\wedge\\dots\\wedge\\dd x_{i_k}", "\\]", "（帽号表示删去一个因子；积分关于 $x$ 光滑，", "由积分号下求导得出，", "见\\cref{thm:b3:lebesgue:paramdiff}，所有导数", "在紧集上被控制）。验证", "\\eqref{eq:b3:forms:homotopy} 是一项一生只做一次的计算，", "故完整写出。固定 $I$，取 $\\omega =", "a\\,\\dd x_I$（由线性性）。首先，", "\\[", "\\dd(h\\omega) = k\\Bigl(\\int_0^1t^{k-1}a(tx)\\dd t\\Bigr)\\dd x_I", "+ \\sum_{r=1}^k(-1)^{r-1}\\sum_{j=1}^n", "\\Bigl(\\int_0^1t^{k}\\,\\partial_ja(tx)\\,\\dd t\\Bigr)", "x_{i_r}\\,\\dd x_j\\wedge\\dd x_{I\\setminus i_r} :", "\\]", "第一组收集的是 $\\dd$ 作用于", "因子 $x_{i_r}$ 的那些项 --- 楔积 $\\dd x_{i_r}\\wedge\\dd", "x_{I\\setminus i_r}$ 重新拼成 $\\dd x_I$，带有符号", "$(-1)^{r-1}$ 恰好抵消前置系数，而 $k$ 个", "$r$ 的取值给出因子 $k$ --- 而第二组", "收集 $\\dd$ 作用于积分号的那些项（链式法则", "提出 $t\\,\\partial_ja(tx)$）。接着，$\\dd\\omega =", "\\sum_j\\partial_ja\\,\\dd x_j\\wedge\\dd x_I$，并应用", "$h$ 在 $k+1$ 次情形的定义，指标 $j$ 占据", "第一个位置：", "\\[", "h(\\dd\\omega) = \\sum_{j=1}^n\\Bigl(\\int_0^1t^{k}", "\\partial_ja(tx)\\dd t\\Bigr)x_j\\,\\dd x_I", "- \\sum_{j=1}^n\\sum_{r=1}^k(-1)^{r-1}", "\\Bigl(\\int_0^1t^{k}\\partial_ja(tx)\\dd t\\Bigr)", "x_{i_r}\\,\\dd x_j\\wedge\\dd x_{I\\setminus i_r} .", "\\]", "两个二重和在 $\\dd(h\\omega) + h(\\dd\\omega)$ 中相消，", "故其等于", "\\[", "\\Bigl(\\int_0^1\\bigl(k\\,t^{k-1}a(tx) +", "t^k{\\textstyle\\sum_j}x_j\\,\\partial_ja(tx)\\bigr)\\dd t\\Bigr)", "\\dd x_I", "= \\Bigl(\\int_0^1\\frac{\\dd}{\\dd t}\\bigl(t^ka(tx)\\bigr)\\dd", "t\\Bigr)\\dd x_I", "= a(x)\\,\\dd x_I = \\omega,", "\\]", "由微积分基本定理。星形性", "在必要之处起了作用：$tx \\in U$ 对 $t \\in \\intcc01$ 成立，", "从而 $a(tx)$ 有意义。", "\\end{proof}", ""]}